## 📑 SLIDE 8 — User Flow & System Architecture

### Layout: Flowchart + architecture tree

**Heading:** `User Flow & System Architecture`

**Side Panel — Prompt + Output Example (as shown in reference PPT):**
> **Prompt:**
> *"Generate me an animated brutalism login form"*
>
> **Output:**
> [Screenshot of generated dark brutalism login form with LOGIN label, USERNAME, PASSWORD fields, and a red SUBMIT button]

---

**Main User Flow:**
```
[User visits site]
     ↓
[Landing Page — /]
     ↓ Clicks "GET STARTED"
[Dashboard — /dashboard]
     ↓ Clicks module card
     ├── [Memory Typing — /memory-typing]
     │       ↓ Setup → Memorize (10s) → Typing → Result
     └── [Colour Clash — /color-clash]
             ↓ Intro → Playing → Result
```

**Memory Typing Flow:**
```
User clicks LAUNCH
  → Phase: SETUP (choose time: 15s / 30s / 60s)
  → Phase: MEMORIZE (paragraph shown, 10s countdown)
  → Phase: TYPING (paragraph hidden, user types from memory)
  → Phase: RESULT (WPM, accuracy, word count shown)
```

**Colour Clash Flow:**
```
User clicks START GAME
  → 10 questions total
  → Each: word displayed in a COLOR (mismatched)
  → Timer bar (TIME_PER_QUESTION seconds)
  → User clicks the text's actual COLOR (not the word)
  → Score: 10 pts + streak bonus
  → Result: Score, Accuracy %, Time taken
```

**Architecture:**
```
Frontend (React + Vite — Vercel)
├── / → Landing.jsx
│   ├── ConstellationGrid (animated background)
│   └── GlitchText "CLUTCH" + GET STARTED button
│
└── /dashboard → Dashboard.jsx
    ├── Sidebar (nav: Dashboard, Memory Typing, CPS King, etc.)
    ├── TopBar (search, dark mode, settings, profile)
    ├── WelcomeCard (avatar, username, global rank)
    ├── StatsCard (Peak WPM, CPS, Rank)
    └── ActiveModules (8 module cards)

/memory-typing → MemoryTyping.jsx
  (Random paragraph gen → Memorize phase → Typing phase → Results)

/color-clash → ColorClash.jsx
  (Stroop effect → 10 questions → Timer → Score + Streak → Results)
```

